NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/memory.Pager.recallFlat kind=method
  digest=b3:ff75e659d5b60002b223b6d331b42ae1b0bac1d744c1bab19183408a74bdf1e5 file=neo/internal/memory/pager.go range=1024:1068 lang=go exported=false byte_range=36494:37857
  sig=func (p *Pager) recallFlat(ctx context.Context, queryText string, types []string, k int, asOf *time.Time) (string, error)
  doc=recallFlat is the flat (single-index) memory lookup: the pinned user profile\nplus a structured cortex.Find retrieval for the query. It is the legacy\nmemory_recall path (continuous-memory off) and the graceful fallback for the\nrecursive path when the timeline reaches nothing.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/memory.Pager
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/memory/pager.go

