  sig=untyped string
  doc=failureModeMarkerPrefix / failureModeMarkerSuffix bracket the canonical\nfailure-mode marker embedded at the head of a self-authored failure-pattern\nstatement, e.g. "[failure-mode:no_progress_stall]". It is the stable dedup\nidentity (self-model task 3.2, req.5.2): the consolidation pass matches a\nrecurrence of the SAME mode against the ONE belief it already wrote, so\nrepeated deaths reinforce a single memory rather than piling up duplicates.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/memory/consolidate.go

